<title>POLAND: Warta to vote on new issue Nov 14.</title>
<headline>Warta to vote on new issue Nov 14.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of the Polish insurance company TUiR Warta SA will vote at a November 14 general shareholders meeting on new share issue ex-rights, the firm said in a statement, giving no details.</p>
<p>Nobody in the company was available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
